    <p class="co-lead">Many internships are only ever advertised on the company's own website. This directory starts from the companies: it finds who operates in Germany, checks each official website, finds the careers page on it and the recruitment platform behind it, and then searches the vacancies there.</p>
    <p class="notice" id="companies-offline" hidden><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i> The company directory is built and kept on your own computer. Run <code>npm run editor</code> and open this page from there.</p>

